/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Street Medicine is a healthcare approach that delivers medical services directly to individuals experiencing homelessness, typically on the streets, aiming to provide care where people live rather than in traditional healthcare facilities.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [11]
>>
